@startuml
title View Curriculums - Retrieve and Display Curriculums List

hide footbox

actor PrimaryActor as "User (Admin / Academic Staff)"
participant Screen as "Screen"
participant API as "API"
participant Router as "Router"
participant Controller as "Controller"
participant Service as "Service"
participant Model as "Model"
database DB as "Database"

activate PrimaryActor
PrimaryActor -> Screen: (1) Open curriculums list
activate Screen
Screen -> API: (2) call GET
activate API
API -> Router: (3) forward GET
activate Router
Router -> Controller: (4) getCurriculums(queryParams)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: (5) findCurriculums({ filters, pagination })
activate Service
Service -> Model: (6) find(query) -- with filters and populate semester
activate Model
Model -> DB: (7) db query
activate DB
DB --> Model: (8) rows[], totalCount
deactivate DB
Model --> Service: (9) curriculums data with semester info
deactivate Model
Service -> Service: (10) apply pagination and format response
Service --> Controller: (11) paginated curriculums list
deactivate Service
Controller --> Router: (12) 200 OK { curriculums[], total, page, limit }
deactivate Controller
Router --> API: (13) 200 OK { curriculums[], total, page, limit }
API --> Screen: (14) render curriculums table/list with semester details
Screen --> PrimaryActor: (15) display results
deactivate Router
deactivate API
deactivate Screen
deactivate PrimaryActor
@enduml

